11 present). Only frames the engine actually rasterized are reported (a frame with no dirty layer is never produced, so no empty frames are counted); continuous redraw by a Ticker that dirties the scene every tick. Frames filtered to rasterFinish within the measured window [start,end] after a 2 s warm-up; timings are batched by the engine so 800 ms extra were waited. Engine switches env: default-backend. images: custom async loader (File.readAsBytes + ui.instantiateImageCodec(targetWidth/Height 128) + getNextFrame; decoding runs on the engine IO thread pool, not the UI isolate). decode_total_ms = sum over images of wall time read+decode (max 4 loads in flight; timer starts when a slot is taken; wall time incl. event-loop hops and CPU contention with the llvmpipe raster threads); counters are for the whole run incl. warm-up. GridView.builder 10 columns x 128 px; scroll = triangle wave over the grid at 3000 px/s; zoom 1->3->1 over 6 s (Transform) with a sinusoidal pan; during warm-up the script is frozen at t=0."}